WEBVTT

00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:26.602
Press / (or the magnifier) to search.

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:31.187
You search activities, diary, coach messages, knowledge and gear.

00:00:31.237 --> 00:00:34.944
The bell: 'Waiting for you' lists proposals only you can approve.

00:00:34.994 --> 00:00:39.526
An AI coach does not just change your plan: its change waits here as a proposal. Approve it and VibeSynergy carries it out; you can also reject it.

00:00:39.576 --> 00:00:43.885
Does another app keep overwriting your plan in intervals.icu, Garmin or your calendar? Here you see where, which sessions and since when.

00:00:43.935 --> 00:00:48.043
After three times VibeSynergy stops putting it back. Stop the other app, then put your plan back here.

00:00:48.093 --> 00:00:52.397
The notices hold today's advice in one line: when and why it was updated, and its first sentence. The top of the screen shows the same line, with 'View'.

00:00:52.447 --> 00:00:56.149
The notices also say when a second opinion differs from your AI coach.

00:00:56.199 --> 00:01:08.738
And which texts VibeSynergy updated itself, without asking.
